5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited for our trip! I want it to be a super fun adventure! To start, let's figure out where we should go! What do you guys think?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is lovely to see your enthusiasm, Sakura. However, before we let our imaginations run wild, I believe it would be prudent to establish a clear understanding of the costs and logistics involved.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Victoria. It would be wonderful to find a place that makes everyone happy, but we should make sure it's practical first. I'm looking forward to hearing everyone's ideas!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"We should be methodical. Before we suggest destinations, we need to understand the logistical constraints and the time required for travel. Let's examine the available data first to ensure the trip is actually sustainable.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with everyone. It's probably best to be careful and look at the details first. I don't want us to pick something that ends up being too difficult for anyone.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"You're all so serious! But okay, let's be detectives first! I want to know about ""All-in rates against meals bought separately"" and ""What separately booked rooms cost last time"" to see how the money works!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that we need a clear financial picture. I will look into ""Pricing of offshore houses let whole"" and ""All-in rates against meals bought separately"" to understand the total cost structure.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I want to understand how we've felt in the past, so I'll check ""Time alone in the shared-house year"" and ""How last year's days ran."" I hope this helps us find a good balance!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will examine ""Ferry sailings and train time"" and ""Getting around by train and bus."" It is essential to quantify the actual time spent in transit to avoid unnecessary exhaustion.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll... I'll look into ""Bathing hours and bathroom provision"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements."" I just want to make sure the daily schedule and the facilities are okay for everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Since Victoria is also checking the meal rates, maybe we can compare our notes later! I wonder if we'll find any secret discounts or something! Does anyone have a place they're dreaming of visiting?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"Comparing notes will be useful, Sakura. I am less interested in discounts and more concerned with the predictability of the final bill. As for a destination, I believe we should wait for the data.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Victoria. It's better to wait until we have the facts. I'm just hoping we can find a way to make sure everyone feels comfortable and included this year. What do you think, Toshio?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I believe the same. Suggesting a destination now would be premature. We must first determine if the travel time is reasonable and if the logistics are efficient. I prefer to base our decision on objective data.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think you're all right. I don't have a specific place in mind. I just hope we can find somewhere that feels... relaxing. I'll wait to see what we find out.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Okay! I'm ready to go on my research mission! I'll find out all the money secrets so we can have the best trip ever! See you all soon!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I shall begin my research now. I want to ensure we have a comprehensive understanding of the total expenses before we commit to any specific plan. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll start my research now too. I really hope we can find a way to make this trip feel just right for everyone. I'll see you all soon!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will proceed with my research. I intend to focus on the efficiency of the transport options to ensure we maximize our actual vacation time. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
