28,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll go look into those things now. I hope the information helps us pick a place where everyone can feel at ease. See you all later.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
